sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor HR as HR Administrator
    participant UI as HRMS Web
    participant DirectorySvc as Directory Service
    participant SettingSvc as Setting Service
    participant DB as Directory DB
    participant Worker as Transfer Worker
    participant Kafka as Kafka
    participant AccessSvc as Access Service
    participant TimeSvc as Time Service
    participant PayrollSvc as Payroll Service

    HR->>UI: Initiate inter-company transfer

    UI->>DirectorySvc: Create Transfer Request<br/>Company A -> Company B<br/>effectiveAt

    DirectorySvc->>SettingSvc: Validate destination Company
    SettingSvc-->>DirectorySvc: Company ACTIVE

    DirectorySvc->>SettingSvc: Validate destination<br/>Location / Department / Grade / Job Title
    SettingSvc-->>DirectorySvc: Valid

    DirectorySvc->>DB: Create pending transfer

    DirectorySvc-->>UI: Transfer scheduled

    Note over DB,Worker: Time reaches effectiveAt

    Worker->>DB: Claim pending transfer
    Worker->>DB: BEGIN

    Worker->>DB: Close Company A employment context
    Worker->>DB: Preserve historical assignment
    Worker->>DB: Activate Company B employment context
    Worker->>DB: Mark transfer COMPLETED
    Worker->>DB: Write outbox event

    Worker->>DB: COMMIT

    Worker->>Kafka: employee.company-transferred

    par Downstream synchronization
        Kafka->>AccessSvc: Update authorization scope
        Kafka->>TimeSvc: Update employment references
        Kafka->>PayrollSvc: Update employment/payroll context
    end